; XAUUSD — New York open range (13:00 GMT). Second, independent setup
; alongside the Asian-range one. Untested: NY was only ever tried as a
; REPLACEMENT for the Asian hour, never as an addition.
; Rules are IDENTICAL to the measured XAUUSD configuration — only the session
; hours change. Do not tune anything else: the point of this test is whether
; the same rules work elsewhere, not whether some rules can be made to work.
; Period: 2025.05.27 -> today, real ticks, random delay, deposit 100000.
; CHECK "history quality" after the run — below ~90% the result is unreliable.

InpMagic=20260811
InpTradeComment=ORB
InpRangeStartHour=16
InpRangeStartMin=0
InpRangeMinutes=60
InpTradeUntilHour=22
InpSessionEndHour=23
InpDryRun=false
InpUseRelativeThresholds=true
InpBufferPctOfRange=1.5
InpMaxSpreadPctOfRange=8.0
InpMinRangeDailyAtr=0.08
InpMaxRangeDailyAtr=0.5
InpAtrPeriod=14
InpDailyAtrPeriod=14
InpRiskPercent=0.5
InpRewardRisk=2.0
InpMaxLot=5.0
InpMaxLotPer10k=0
InpDailyLossCapPct=3.0
InpMaxTradesPerDay=1
InpMaxOpenPos=1
InpOnePerDirection=true
InpUseBreakEven=false
InpBreakEvenAtR=1.0
InpUseTrailing=false
InpTrailRMult=1.5
InpBreakoutBuffer=20
InpMaxSpreadPoints=60.0
InpCloseAtSessionEnd=true
InpNoFriday=false
